    "field_description": [
        {
            "value": "There are many complaints about the Paragraphs module, but it's a module I wouldn't build a Drupal site without, Decoupled or otherwise. Complexity with nested paragraphs is a common issue though, but usually a necessary evil. However we recently implemented the Layout Paragraphs module into the Foundry Drupal backend, and I've been really happy with what I've seen. So today I'm experimenting with Druxt and the Layout Paragraphs module"
        }
